ageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of Patriot's elite defenders. Carrying out Patriot's will, these shieldguards form the solid foundation of the 'Aegis of the Infected.' Equipped with high-performance protective armor, they cover for their comrades by drawing fire from enemies while present on the battlefield.","abilities":["More likely to be targeted by attacks."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":700,"def":1300,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"chalice_of_mortality":{"slug":"chalice_of_mortality","name":"Chalice of Mortality","icon":"/enemies-icons/Chalice of Mortality.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Greater soul chalice born of a revenant's will, brimming with conviction immeasurable. The future, unforeseen but destined, is the ultimate verdict.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Shares a fraction of the damage taken by non-aerial enemies around itself."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":125000,"atk":0,"def":0,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"sudaram":{"slug":"sudaram","name":"Sudaram","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sudaram.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The Sudaram is the shroud of the dead. Once gaunt from hunger, it is now nourished by the power of the Nachzehrer King. For the Nachzehrer, consumption and nourishment—greed and devotion—are just two sides of the same dreaded coin.","abilities":["Attacks deal Physical damage to all surrounding units.","When inside Originium pollution or an Active Originium Storm, attacks deal Physical damage to all surrounding allied units and all your units inside Originium pollution or Active Originium Storms."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":900,"def":500,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"infused_soul_husk":{"slug":"infused_soul_husk","name":"Infused Soul Husk","icon":"/enemies-icons/Infused Soul Husk.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"Soul husk born of a revenant's will, imbued with the techniques of countless heroes in its memories. The heroes have all but fallen, leaving behind only indistinct silhouettes as memories.","abilities":["Can pick up and retain up to 3 Soul Maelstroms.","When carrying a Soul Maelstrom, expends Soul Maelstrom to summon an orbiting soul orb that deals heavy Arts damage to your units that collide into it."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":900,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"patriot":{"slug":"patriot","name":"Patriot","icon":"/enemies-icons/Patriot.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"His armor is in disrepair and damaged in many places. The blade of his once sharp halberd is now eroded with rust. However, the indomitable Patriot never capitulates, never backs down, and never shows mercy. He has long struggled with fate, and now resolves to slit the throat of fate.","abilities":["Greatly increases the ATK and DEF of enemy units","Marching Stance","Gains greatly increased ATK, DEF, and RES. Becomes more likely to be targeted by your units, and normal attacks strike 4 times","Enters a revival state when HP drops to 0, continuously dealing True damage to units around him. After a period of time, enters Ruination stance","Ruination Stance","Can perform long-ranged attacks","Deals Physical damage to the farthest high ground unit","